  "uncertainty_basis": "Empirical ranges allowed for panorama stitching, manual marking and station offsets. Independent 2015 view-pairs give A–C approximately 5.9–6.9 m. The second small top window near A is partly obscured. Individual sill heights tilt modestly in the fitted solution, so the difference between B and C sill is unresolved. White aperture edges and casement axes are distinct.",
